#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duenna Stage 1 — independent execution bundle.

This single file carries the complete Stage 1 closure-harness
suite exactly as examined at shelf commit 69f9a6a7 (validator,
anchor, closure, record, runner, and all eight test files).
Running it materialises the files into a fresh temporary
directory, prints each file's SHA-256 so the runner can verify
the bundle against the examined sources, and then executes the
real test suite there:  python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v

Expected result: Ran 68 tests — OK.

Nothing here is pre-computed: the tests run live, in the
runner's own environment, against the real code.
"""

